From f1cad2aa35fe902a3402a73e0eac7683c3423596 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Slashy <amirramy.chatbi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 17:48:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] feat(p01): prompt size is configurable, and the pool
 respects a provider's request limit

Removing 41 tool schemas left the prompt at 26k tokens: the bulk is conversation
history and the memory block, not the tools. contextTurns and memoryBudget make
both configurable, and a provider can declare maxPromptChars so the pool skips
it rather than spending a call to be refused with 413.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NptGK4Xppd57AQrT6DuM24
